# Intentionally near-empty.
#
# npm-packlist applies nested .gitignore files even to paths allow-listed in the
# root package.json "files" field, so hex/.gitignore's `dist/` rule was silently
# stripping the compiled themes out of the rig tarball. An .npmignore takes
# precedence over a .gitignore in the same directory, so this file's only job is
# to exist and let hex/dist ship.
#
# hex/dist stays gitignored — it is build output, published but not committed.

node_modules/
